# Automated Fix Verification

When applying Bugbot, Dependabot, agent-authored, or other automated review
fixes, do not treat the bot result as merge-ready by itself.

Before saying a PR is ready to merge after automated fixes, run the affected CI
suite locally when practical:

```bash
npm run ci:affected -- --base=origin/main --head=HEAD
```

If the change touches API, auth, persistence, CLI/MCP behavior, or the browser
runtime, also run the relevant integration command from the PR template.

Always check GitHub PR checks after pushing automated fixes. CI is the final
authority; Bugbot passing does not mean required GitHub Actions are green.
